      "sourceText": "1.  Noetic是ROS1的LTS（长支持版），将于2025年5月31日EOF寿终正寝，自带算法比较老，依赖于其他非自带算法，但是教程最多，第三方算法支持也比较多。\n\n2.  Humble是ROS2的第一个LTS，支持到2027年5月31日或海龟节，自带老版Gazebo Classic和新版Igntion Gazebo（独一份支持新旧两个Gazebo版本比较好的ROS版本），选择性比较广，自带算法比较新，教程正在逐渐增多中，第三方算法也在逐渐增多中，很多用ROS1的人都在往ROS2Humble上转。\n\n3.  Jazzy是ROS2第二个LTS，支持到2029年5月31日或海龟节，在Humble的基础上，多了一些功能，但只有新版Gazebo Sim，针对Jazzy做ROS2教程的资料很少很少，而且很多第三方算法也并未针对Jazzy做相应版本，但是Jazzy目前来看兼容很多Humble的算法与教程，目前除了新版Gazebo改名需要改一些标记语言的标签外，没发现其他代码不兼容的地方。",
      "translatedText": "1.  Noetic is the LTS (Long Term Support) version of ROS1, and it will reach EOF (End of Life) on May 31, 2025\\. Its built\\-in algorithms are relatively old and depend on other non\\-built\\-in algorithms, but it has the most tutorials and relatively extensive support for third\\-party algorithms\\.\n\n2.  Humble is the first LTS of ROS2, supported until May 31, 2027, or Turtle Day\\. It includes both the older Gazebo Classic and the newer Ignition Gazebo (the only ROS version that supports both the old and new Gazebo versions relatively well), offering a relatively broad range of options\\. Its built\\-in algorithms are relatively new, its tutorials are gradually increasing, and third\\-party algorithms are also gradually increasing\\. Many people using ROS1 are transitioning to ROS2 Humble\\.\n\n3.  Jazzy is the second LTS of ROS2, supported until May 31, 2029, or Turtle Day\\. Based on Humble, it adds some features, but only supports the new Gazebo Sim\\. There are very few tutorials for ROS2 Jazzy, and many third\\-party algorithms have not released corresponding versions for Jazzy\\. However, from what has been seen so far, Jazzy is compatible with many Humble algorithms and tutorials\\. Currently, aside from needing to change some markup language tags due to the renaming of the new Gazebo, no other code incompatibilities have been found\\.",
