      "sourceText": "| 示例 | 讲了什么 | 新出现的语法 | 为什么这样写 | 注意事项 |\n|:---|:---|:---|:---|:---|\n| 示例 1 | 统一接收不同容器 | `std::span<const int>` 作为参数 | 一个函数处理 vector/array/C 数组 | span 只是视图，不拥有数据 |\n| 示例 2 | 子视图操作 | `subspan()`、`first()`、`last()` | 零拷贝切片，可以局部处理大数组 | 子视图修改影响原数据 |\n| 示例 3 | 用 span 写通用函数 | `sum(std::span<const double>)` | 通用算法 + 任意连续容器 | 函数内部用 range-for 和 .size() 即可 |",
      "translatedText": "| Example | What was discussed | Newly introduced syntax | Why it is written this way | Notes |\n|:---|:---|:---|:---|:---|\n| Example 1 | Uniformly accept different containers | `std::span<const int>`As a parameter | A single function handles vector/array/C arrays | span is only a view, it does not own data |\n| Example 2 | Subview operations | `subspan()`、`first()`、`last()` | Zero\\-copy slicing, can locally process large arrays | Subview modifications affect the original data |\n| Example 3 | Use span to write generic functions | `sum(std::span<const double>)` | Generic algorithms \\+ arbitrary contiguous containers | Inside the function, use range-for and \\.size() |",
